// Mini Golf: keys 1 to 9 set the power, an arrow (or a tap beside the ball) hits it that way;
// it rolls that many squares and turns back at walls. Sink it on all 3 holes in few strokes.
// icon: line 15 21 15 4 fill 15 4 21 7 15 10 dot 9 18 3
state hole = 1;
