// Hit the red target on 3 levels, wind and all, with 8 shells; shells blast the ground away.
// icon: ring 8 16 4 line 10 12 18 5 line 3 21 21 21 line 14 4 21 4 line 16 8 22 8
state ground = [false; 180];    // the ground still standing, a square each
