// Escape room: Start the 90 second clock, search the room for a key, a torch and three notes,
// then set the dials to the code and Open the door. A wrong code costs 10 seconds.
// icon: loop 6 2 18 2 18 22 6 22 dot 15 13 2 line 2 22 22 22
