// Class schedule: type a class and the hour it starts (8 to 17) and press Add; it keeps the day in
// order and warns of clashes.
// icon: loop 4 3 20 3 20 21 4 21 line 8 8 16 8 line 8 12 16 12 line 8 16 13 16
