// Shikaku: tap two squares to draw the box they are corners of; tap a box to remove it. Fill the
// board with boxes, each holding one number: its size.
// icon: loop 3 3 21 3 21 21 3 21 line 12 3 12 21 line 12 12 21 12 dot 7 12 2
