// Shell game for two: tap a cup to hide the ball, tap two cups to swap them (as often as you
// like) while your friend looks away, then Done: your friend taps a cup to guess.
// icon: fill 3 18 6 8 10 8 13 18 fill 13 18 16 8 20 8 23 18 dot 8 21 2
state cups = [4, 4, 4];   // the cups' colors as shown
