// Weaving: dye the warp (top row) and weft (left column) threads with the color buttons and
// pick a weave; the cloth shows whichever thread lies on top at each crossing.
// icon: line 6 3 6 21 line 12 3 12 21 line 18 3 18 21 line 3 8 21 8 line 3 16 21 16
