// Parcel sort: parcels ride the belt; press Red, Blue or Green to send each to its bin before
// it falls off the end. Three mistakes, wrong or missed, end the game.
// icon: loop 2 15 22 15 22 20 2 20 fill 8 7 15 7 15 13 8 13
